.TH DANBY-BUNGEE 1
.SH NAME
danby-bungee \- slack-to-elastic bungee-jump dynamics
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/bungee
.SH MODEL
The jumper first free-falls with air drag.  Once fall distance exceeds cord
length, elastic and damping forces engage.  This piecewise force law exposes
the transition from slack cord to oscillatory recovery.
.SH DISPLAY
The cord length follows computed fall distance; distance and speed are plotted.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/bungee.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR mechanism (2)
